     A                                  1 12'MATERIALS CONTROL REQUISITION UPDA-
     A                                      TE INSTRUCTIONS'
     A                                  1 76'MA2-3'
     A                                  3  1'THERE ARE FOUR (4) OPTIONS YOU CAN'
     A                                  3 36'CHOOSE WHEN PROCESSING A REQUISITI-
     A                                      ON:'
     A                                  4  2'1) RELEASE THE REQUISITION - THE Q-
     A                                      UANTITY TO ORDER IS CORRECT AND THE'
     A                                  5 31'REQUISITION IS RELEASED TO PURCHAS-
     A                                      ING.'
     A                                  6 17'PROCEDURE   - VERIFY THE QUANTITY'
     A                                  6 51'TO ORDER IS CORRECT'
     A                                  7 31'AND PRESS THE "ENTER" KEY.'
     A                                  8  2'2) MODIFY THE QTY. THEN    - THE Q-
     A                                      UANTITY TO ORDER IS MODIFIED AND TH-
     A                                      E'
     A                                  9  5'RELEASE THE REQUISITION   REQUISIT-
     A                                      ION IS RELEASED TO PURCHASING.'
     A                                 10 17'PROCEDURE   - MODIFIY THE REQUISIT-
     A                                      ION QUANTITY TO THE DESIRED'
     A                                 11 31'QUANTITY THEN RELEASE THE REQUISIT-
     A                                      ION BY'
     A                                 12 31'PRESSING THE "ENTER" KEY.'
     A                                 13  2'3) HOLD THE REQUISITION    - THE R-
     A                                      EQUISITION IS NOT RELEASED BY MATER-
     A                                      IALS'
     A                                 14 31'CONTROL AND IS PLACED IN A HOLD ST-
     A                                      ATUS.'
     A                                 15 17'PROCEDURE   - ENTER THE HOLD STATU-
     A                                      S DESIRED IN THE HOLD'
     A                                 16 31'OPTION BOX AND PRESS THE "ENTER" K-
     A                                      EY.'
     A                                 17  2'4) CANCEL THE REQUISITION  - THE R-
     A                                      EQUISITION IS NOT REQUIRED AND DOES-
     A                                       NOT'
     A                                 18 31'HAVE A P.O. ASSOCIATED WITH IT THE-
     A                                      REFORE IT'
     A                                 19 31'IS CANCELLED.'
     A                                 20 17'PROCEDURE   - PLACE AN "X" IN THE'
     A                                 20 51'CANCEL OPTION BOX AND'
     A                                 21 31'PRESS THE "ENTER" KEY.'
     A                                 22  6'DEPRESS: "f3" TO RETURN TO THE REQ-
     A                                      UISITION UPDATE SCREEN'
